prefix detroit https://detroitmi.gov/zoning/
class DecisionMakingBody
class BoardDecision
class BoardVote
class NecessityFinding
class RecordCertification
individual DetroitBZA types DecisionMakingBody
property decision_by domain BoardDecision range DecisionMakingBody min 1 max 1
property rendered_by_vote domain BoardDecision range BoardVote min 1 max 1
property finding_for domain NecessityFinding range BoardDecision
property certified_by domain NecessityFinding range RecordCertification
datatype occurred_at domain BoardVote range LocalDateTime min 1 max 1
